        <ArticleTitle>Aspirin and Cardiovascular Events after STEMI: A Randomized Trial.</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND">Low-dose aspirin reduces recurrent cardiovascular events after STEMI.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="METHODS">We randomly assigned 1200 patients to aspirin or placebo after STEMI.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">Aspirin reduced 30-day mortality by 23% (p=0.01).</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSIONS">Aspirin should be continued after STEMI.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
